{#-
  BLOCK: bands — §06's `bands`. The price-distribution bars.

  Each band: its label and "n listings · share" line, then a two-cell bar —
  the brand fill and the `#ECEAE3` remainder — which is how a bar chart is drawn
  in email: no SVG, no background-image, no CSS width, because Outlook supports
  none of them.

  D-115 OVER DESIGN'S 2% MINIMUM. The 5th package asks for a 2% floor on the bar;
  D-115 removed exactly that floor on 2026-10-01, because a 2% bar beside a label
  reading 0% or 1% depicts a number the reader cannot see. `bar_pct` is parsed
  from the printed label in `_band_rows()`, so the bar and the label cannot
  disagree, and a band whose share rounds to zero draws no filled cell at all
  (`width="0%"` renders as a hairline in several clients). The count is on every
  row, so the band itself never disappears.

  The bar is a FILL in the brand colour, never text, so it takes `primary`
  unmodified.
-#}
          <tr><td class="tr-pad" style="padding:14px 28px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;">
            {%- for b in bands %}<tr><td style="padding:10px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;"><tr><td align="left" class="tr-ink" style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">{{ b.label }}</td><td align="right" class="tr-muted" style="font-size:12.5px;color:#64748B;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">{{ b.count }} listings · {{ b.pct }}</td></tr></table><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin-top:8px;border-collapse:collapse;"><tr>{% if b.bar_pct %}<td width="{{ b.bar_pct }}%" height="10" bgcolor="{{ primary }}" style="height:10px;background:{{ primary }};font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td>{% endif %}<td width="{{ b.empty_pct }}%" height="10" bgcolor="#ECEAE3" class="tr-rule" style="height:10px;background:#ECEAE3;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr>{% endfor %}
          </table></td></tr>
